    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Next open viewing is scheduled for Saturday, 3rd October, from 10:30am - 11:10am.\n\nGet Property Estate Agents are delighted to bring 2 New Street North, Smithfield to the open market.\n\nTotalling c.73 sq. m., this charming cottage is deceptively larger than one would expect when on the street. It was completely refurbished in recent years and is now a contemporary, light-filled house. It has a C BER rating and gas fired central heating. \n\nLocated just off Church Street, New Street North is a beautiful street of terraced houses which has a neighbourly feel to it. An extremely central and convenient location, just 1.4km to O`Connell Bridge, 400m to Four Courts LUAS (red line) and 550m to Broadstone LUAS (green line). \n\n2 New Street North will appeal to both first-time buyers or anyone seeking a central location in the hustle and bustle of Dublin`s City life while also maintaining a warm, neighbourly vibe from the community. \n\nAccommodation:\nEntrance hallway. Composite door, wooden flooring.\nLiving Room & Kitchen. 6.12m x 3.05m. Wooden flooring, integrated kitchen, skylights, storage under stairwell. The flat roof above was re-sealed in 2024. GFCH.\nDownstairs Bedroom. 3.12m x 3.02m. Wooden flooring with double glazed sash windows.\nShower Room. 2.72m x 1.09m. In excellent condition.\nAttic. 3.97m x 3.48m. Three Velux windows and storage in the eaves.\nRear Yard. Ample storage for bins, etc.\nFront Exterior. Repointed, in extremely good condition.\n\nViewing of this impressive property is highly recommended and open viewings shall take place weekly. Should you have any questions then please either complete the form to the right of this page or phone Diana Farkas of Get Property Estate Agents on 086 0328362.\n\nEstablished in 2005, Get Property Estate Agents are fully licensed and regulated by the PSRA (002324).\n\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\n"
      },
